{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10841","headline":"水阁朝霁奉简严云安 · 杜甫","name":"水阁朝霁奉简严云安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东城抱春岑，江阁邻石面。\n崔嵬晨云白，朝旭射芳甸。\n雨槛卧花丛，风牀展书卷。\n钩帘宿鹭起，丸药流莺啭。\n呼婢取酒壶，绩儿诵文选。\n晚交严明府，矧此数相见。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}